SUMMARY:Winter Camp Training
LOCATION:Lost Lake Scout Camp\, Fairbanks\, Alaska
DESCRIPTION:Midnight Sun Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/696-win
 tertraining\n\n\n\nGet ready to embrace the cold and put your outdoor sur
 vival skills to the test!\nScouts will spend Saturday learning essential 
