 ey built!\nImportant Details:\nTraining: Saturday\, followed by overnight
  camping in Scout-built shelters.\nTroop Responsibilities: Each Troop mus
 t provide its own adult leadership\, camping gear\, and all meals.\nOptio
 nal Friday Arrival:
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/696-wintertraining
