DESCRIPTION:Great Alaska Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/610-Gor
 suchScoutCamp27\n\n\n\nLocated on Mirror Lake as part of the Rasmuson Sco
 ut Reservation\, Camp Gorsuch offers week-long overnight camping for S
 couts from the Great Alaska Council and other visiting Councils. The pro
 gram has been designed to offer Scouts a wide variety of fun\, challengin
 g opportunities to help them progress along the Trail to Eagle and a wid
 e variety of Merit Badges. Gorsuch features Project C.O.P.E. for Scouts 
 13 years and older highlighting the Nanuk Lodge Brotherhood Climbing T
 ower. Information to be
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/610-GorsuchScoutCamp27
